## Events Leading to Crash

System was connected via MLO (WiFi 7) to AP d8:b3:70:f8:9e:7b. User roamed
to different AP d8:b3:70:f8:89:4f, triggering disconnect/reconnect sequence.
Association was rejected temporarily, then timed out. During this state,
MCU messages began timing out, triggering firmware reset recovery which
crashed due to NULL vif pointer.

